examples:
MemoryDemo 可以定义：
	exttt{void* operator new(std::size\_t size);}
	exttt{void operator delete(void* ptr) noexcept;}
	exttt{void* operator new[](std::size\_t size);}
	exttt{void operator delete[](void* ptr) noexcept;}

示例程序分别执行普通对象、数组对象、nothrow 对象和 nothrow 数组的分配与释放，输出中出现：
	exttt{operator new}
	exttt{operator delete}
	exttt{operator new[]}
	exttt{operator delete[]}
	exttt{operator new nothrow}
	exttt{operator delete[] nothrow}
